Interop test peer (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
---------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds bacnet-stack 1.6.1
(https://github.com/bacnet-stack/bacnet-stack, Copyright Steve Karg and
contributors, GPL-2.0 with the GCC linking exception) from its sources
in a Docker container on the tester's machine and runs its client tools
as separate processes. No bacnet-stack source or binary is included in
this repository; the image is not distributed.

Test data
---------

Every address, device instance and value in this module is a made-up
demo value; none belongs to a real installation.
